  "description": "EfCore.Boost adds a provider-aware Unit of Work + Repository layer on top of EF Core, plus utilities for routines, bulk operations, and OData suport.\n        Designed for consistent cross-database behavior (SQL Server/Azure, PostgreSQL, MySQL) using conventions and explicit safety boundaries.",
