  "releaseNotes": "Better support for change tracking. \nHasChanges() method on the UOW and the Ropositories.\nChangeSummary() method on the UOW to get detailed information on all changes trackeed.\nClearTracking() and RejectAllChanges() on UOW and each Repository.\nOn Repository we now have methods like DetailedChanges(), Changes(), LoadedEntities() and TrackedEntities(), Detach(T), ReloadAsync() etc.",
